DETEKT/KTLINT NOTE (honesty, no red-as-green): detekt + ktlintCheck are NOT part of this
artifact's binding gate (the prompt gate = placeholder + assembleDebug + lintDebug +
testDebugUnitTest, and the sibling A7 pages were accepted on that same triad). The three new
.kt files compile clean and pass Android lint.

UNITS/A11Y/THEME: no unit-bearing display value on this page (the catalog stores SI column
names as schema text, not computed quantities), so there is no SI conversion at this boundary
(S5 N/A here). Every color/typography is a MaterialTheme/TeslaTokens token (dark + dynamic
theme, ADR-005/ADR-015). The two GlassPanels + each table Card carry non-merging
Modifier.semantics contentDescription; the Run help message carries liveRegion=Polite (the
native analogue of the web `role="status"`); Material 3 enforces the >=48dp Button targets.

